# Health Simplified

Health Simplified is a command-line application for tracking users, food entries, meal plans, and health goals. It uses Python, Typer, and SQLAlchemy with a SQLite database.

## Features

- User management (create, list)
- Food entry tracking
- Meal planning
- Goal setting

